# Intruder Alarm: Bot1's Ornithopter attacks on turn 3 and, with the Alarm out, does not untap in its controller's
# untap step on turn 5 (CR 502.3). Casting a second Ornithopter triggers "whenever a creature enters, untap all
# creatures", which untaps it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island
